There is no need to formulate a hypothesis. ThesisOut runs a global search across university repositories and pulls the highest-signal findings automatically. Use the All Global Findings button in the top bar, filter by discipline, or drop a thesis PDF or CSV with zero manual typing.

3
00:00:33,708 --> 00:00:51,167
Right below, Section Zero One makes the revealed dissertations and high-value opportunities immediately obvious and clear. Each card pairs the source university thesis and overlooked variable with the commercial product to build, model signal gain, and Translation Score.

4
00:00:51,167 --> 00:01:12,375
Clicking any card opens Section Zero Two, the High-Value Opportunity Dossier. It details the overlooked empirical finding, why the original thesis missed it, and live registry whitespace. Four action buttons let you run five-fold verification, draft a patent claim, audit live registries, and download the Python model.

5
00:01:12,375 --> 00:01:31,708
Section Zero Three is the thirty-model Empirical Clue Board. Every architecture is evaluated out of fold with ninety-five percent confidence intervals. Here ExtraTreesRegressor lifts R-squared from the author's zero point six one baseline to zero point nine one four, a thirty point four percent gain.

6
00:01:31,708 --> 00:01:51,167
